[stderr] +## Reference boundary
[stderr] +
[stderr] +The Athletic and QuizUp may inform only football-topic breadth, varied quiz
[stderr] +formats, and the broad goal of short trivia sessions. They never authorize
[stderr] +copied brands, questions/wording, assets, layouts, screen composition, audio,
[stderr] +social copy, interaction choreography, or other distinctive expression. All
